// Labeled recognition-detection set. One JSON object per line: {text, expected:[{helperHandle,kind}]}.
// Ground truth = what a CORRECT detector should emit (helper the author credits + the kind of help).
// Empty expected = a true negative. `//` lines and blank lines are ignored by parseLabeledJsonl.
// Handles are lowercased; kind is one of answered|unblocked|reviewed|paired.
//
